window.products.push({"id":683033,"name":"LIANLAM 1000 Thread Count Cotton Sheets Set, Smooth Luxury Egyptian 100% Cotton Sheets - 4 Piece, Cool Breathable Bed Sheets,16\" Elasticized Deep Pock","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51D3WQv1puL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"100% Cotton 100% PURE COTTON FOR PREMIUM COMFORT & SOFTNESS: Experience the luxury and silky-soft feel brought together by 1000 threads woven per square inch with our premium Egyptian cotton like sheets. These 1000 thread count sheet sets are the perfect blend of breathability and durability, making them the ideal remedy for night sweats. 100% natural long staple cotton yarns are woven together using sateen weave to give you the ideal comfort and smoothness of 5-star hotel bedding. CERTIFIED GREEN WEAVING & DYEING: All our dyes, auxiliaries, and our sheets are OEKOTEX and GOTS certified to ensure your safety. LIANLAM sheets maintain sustainable & chemical-free. These ultra soft cotton cooling sheets are extremely safe for your health (and for our ocean too!). SNUG FIT:Looking for a fitted sheet in the 4-piece set that actually stays in its place and doesn't come off? Our fitted sheet comes with an all-around elastic to fit your mattress perfectly. The head/foot side indicator tells you how to make the bed easily. WHAT'S INCLUDE: Each California King Size Sheet Set comes with 1× Fitted Sheet 72\"×84\"×16\" + 1× Flat Sheet 108\"×102\"+2× Pillowcases 20\"×40\". Care Guidance: Machine wash our 100% cotton queen size sheets in warm water and tumble dry on low heat, do not bleach. When machine drying, do not dry at high temperatures.LIANLAM cotton bed sheets will not fade, even after many machine washes. Pill-Proof & Odor-Free! Cotton tends to soften up with washing, so allow the sheets a couple washes to experience their silky softness. YOUR SATISFACTION IS IMPORTANT TO US: Along with superior comfort and luxury, our products also come with incredible customer service and 100% satisfaction guarantee. If you encounter any problems, you can contact us.Gift them to your loved ones and family or simply add them to your stunning room decor and enjoy bespoke californian luxury with our high quality sheets.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51D3WQv1puL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LIANLAM","source_asin":"B0BR5KH6WL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-683033","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BR5KH6WL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BR5KH6WL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
