window.products.push({"id":683186,"name":"ESTTOP St Patricks Day Pillow Covers 18×18, Set of 4 Throw Pillow Covers, Happy St Patrick's Day Decor, Green Lucky Clover, Load of Luck, Indoor Green","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ggH97gDIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cotton Linen Fabric ST PATRICK’S DAY DECOR - Celebrate the coming St Patrick’s day with ESTTOP pillow covers. The green hat, clove, the words “LUCKY” and other elements that full of St Patrick’s day atmosphere announce the holiday with sophisticated country style. The invisible hidden-zipper can also reflect how exquisite the craft is. Decorate your sofa with these farmhouse holiday pillow cover to create a charming focal point for your home and enjoy your leisure time. PREMUIM MATERIAL - Made of durable and friendly cotton linen fabric, comfortable & soft touch. No fading or fraying issue. The decorative pillow covers can be used for a long time and can be removed for cleaning in washing machine. Also a perfect farmhouse style spring decor for home. It is the gorgeous decoration during St Patrick's Day, and also provides a lovely gift for your family and friends. IDEAL SIZE FOR ALL ROOMS - 4 pack pillow covers measure 18 x 18 inch which are appropriate and perfect for you to put them on patio, sofa, couch or outdoor chairs. Suggest to fill in 20 x 20 inches pillow inserts to make them fuller. It can be used to decorate the bedroom, living room, dining room, study, bed, sofa, cushion, chair, etc. No insert included. EASY TO PUT ON - With the premium hidden zipper, it is super easy to cram your insert/filler into this cover. The zippers are further reinforced by process upgrades and will not easily split when filling the pillow inserts. The stitching of the pillow cover is tight and of good quality. 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEED - ESTTOP guarantee that the high quality pillow cover will surely please you! If, for any reason, you are not 100% satisfied with our products, we will issue you a full refund or a replacement!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ggH97gDIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ESTTOP","source_asin":"B09MT6TF15","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-683186","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MT6TF15","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MT6TF15","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
