window.products.push({"id":683287,"name":"Riuynut Sorority Gifts Pillow Cover,Sorority Paraphernalia Decorative Pillow Case for Decorative Bedroom/Livingroom/Sofa/Farm House 18 x 18 Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BC1wO1blL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Material:High Quality PolyesterSize:18 x 18 Inch(45cm x 45cm)Shape:SquarePackage: 1 x Throw Pillow CaseFeature:1. Its widely used in any place. Also best gifts for any festival you like.2. The pillow case have hidden zipper closure in one side of pillow cover, its barely noticeable and easy to washing.Warm Tip:1.One pillow cover only, insert is not include.2.Please allowed 1-2cm deviations due to hand-cutting and sewing.3.Please do not put the pillow core vertically into the pillowcase to avoid the zipper ripped.4.Factors such as lighting, contrast and color display can cause the photo to look different from the actual product, this is not indicative of any product quality issues.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BC1wO1blL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Riuynut","source_asin":"B09TWLNZJ2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-683287","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TWLNZJ2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TWLNZJ2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":683288,"name":"Gluggle Jug, Cobalt Blue Rooster, Extra Large (10-inch)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71g3lgT+8fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Designed to gurgle, this unique Wade product with its classic Rooster design, will be the talking point in more ways than one, every time it is put to use. Never before has adding liquid to a drink or pouring water on its own been such fun. Fully glazed, the Gluggle Jug is another example of Wade's design abilities, production skills and manufacturing prowess which place Wade Ceramics in a league few can catch. The ever popular Gluggle Jug range has grown, with four exciting new designs; Orca the Whale, a dolphin, an alligator and a hippocamp, a mythological creature with a horse's head and a scaly Rooster like tail. A fascinating item of tableware that is sure to add character to your home. Each Gluggle Jug is designed as a fully functioning water jug but has its own sound effect. A three-quarter full, each jug, when being poured will Gluggle merrily.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71g3lgT+8fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wade Ceramics","source_asin":"B006OBAKPE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-683288","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B006OBAKPE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B006OBAKPE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
