window.products.push({"id":683305,"name":"Angadona Macaron Baking Kit Silicone Mat - (22pcs set), 2 Half Sheet Macaron Silicone Mat,12 Piping Tip,2 Piping Bag with 4 Bag Tie,2 coupler, macaroo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BzUovsl1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【MACAROON BAKING KIT NON-STICK EASY CLEAN-UP】-No more scraping!Macaroon baking mat nonstick surface allows for effortless food removal without waste. Even burnt sugar and fat falls off on its on,just simply wash the silicone baking mats by hand or rinse in warm soapy water and allow to air dry, or place in dishwasher (top rack only).The macaron mats are a baker's dream at save time cleaning up,preventing a messy oven,dirty pan.Save on baking sheets&pans! 【OVEN-SAFE BAKE LIKE A PROFESSIONAL AT HOME】-Baking mats made of the highest quality food grade silicone, up to 480 degrees F,designed for use in all types of ovens (except direct-fire ovens),which provides consistent heat distribution and promotes even baking and browning,get consistent results,no more burned and under-baked spots.Features guide lines for 30 macaron for each sheet,the template helps you apply the right amount of batter for perfect macaroons,cookies. 【SILICONE BAKING MAT KIT UPGRADE BAKING AND ROASTING】-.With macaron mat eliminates the use for cooking sprays,grease and oils, reducing calories in your meal and reduces intake of cholesterol,cancerogenic substances produced by cooking oils subjected to high temperatures.With silicone baking sheet create fat free dishes,they won't absorb odors or flavors,keep your family healthy.Stop buying expensive parchment paper!Saves money,reduces waste 【MACARON BAKING MAT VERSITILITY&DURABLE REUSABLE】- The baking options are nearly endless with the nonstick macaron silicone mat, including sticky caramels, gooey bread, or even baked fish. And use like a pastry mat for nonslip nonstick dough rolling.The bake mats are resilient enough to handle metal spatulas or utensils without damage(avoiding serrated edges).Superior strength,it's flexible yet tear resistant,designed to withstand thousands of uses under extreme conditions( -40°F to 480°F). 【100% MONEY-BACK GUARANTEE】 -Pls note all of the items(pastry bags and piping tips) inside of our gift box.We are so pleased that our customers love our macaroon baking mats set.We offer a 100% MONEY BACK GUARANTEE if you are not completely satisfied. Return them anytime for a full refund of your purchase price.No questions asked!Your satisfaction is our priority.Our premium silicone macaron baking mat kit make perfect gift for Weddings,Housewarming Parties,Baby Shower,Christmas,Thanksgiving Day","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BzUovsl1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Angadona","source_asin":"B0C6KTR3BY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-683305","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6KTR3BY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6KTR3BY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
