window.products.push({"id":683352,"name":"Xtra-Comfort Memory Foam Mattress Topper (Twin XL) - 3 Inch Thick Gel Bed Pad - Soft Sleeping Pillow Top for RV Camping & Dorm - Egg Crate Alternative","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AfBXnFR0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"3” Mattress Topper Enhance the comfort of any mattress with a Xtra-Comfort mattress topper. Constructed with a cooling, gel-infused foam, the 3” foam topper provides soft cushioning and full body support for side sleepers, back sleepers and stomach sleepers to relieve painful pressure points. The open-cell memory foam also allows air to freely circulate and heat to dissipate for cool comfort throughout the night. Available in five standard mattress sizes including twin, twin XL, full, queen and king. Upgrade Your Mattress: Providing exceptional cushioning and support, the gel-infused mattress topper adds softness and prolongs the life of your mattress while creating a comfortable sleep experience. Contouring to the body, the 3” mattress topper is great for side, back and stomach sleepers, relieving painful pressure points and promoting proper alignment for greater comfort. Soft Memory Foam: Soft and supportive, the open-celled memory foam promotes greater airflow and allows heat to quickly dissipate for exceptional comfort. Unscented, the high-quality, latex-free mattress topper is constructed with CertiPUR-US memory foam that is performance and emissions-tested. Infused with Cooling Gel: In addition to integrated ventilation holes, the memory foam topper is infused with a cooling gel that draws heat away from the body to regulate sleep temperatures throughout the night. What’s Included: Xtra-Comfort 3” Mattress Topper Xtra-Comfort 3” Mattress Topper","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AfBXnFR0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Xtra-Comfort","source_asin":"B07HG978K9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-683352","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HG978K9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HG978K9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
