window.products.push({"id":683388,"name":"Electric Heated Blanket Throw King Size,Sherpa Twin Warming Electric Blanket with Overheating Protection,Heating Blanket with 6 Fast Heating Levels 10","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":66.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71At08qF6JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Stable heating: High quality PTC/NTC heating wire is used for electric blanket. For reliable use, the electric blanket has overheating protection safety system, which will automatically shut off the electric blanket when overheating. For best user experience, please set the heating level to 3-6 when you open the electric blanket. LED controller: The electric blanket has 4-timing settings,with the time of 2-4-6-10 hours,the temperature of 6-levels,38-42-45-48-52-55° C,to meet your needs. The electric blanket also comes with a timer,just set the time you want. By default, the electric blanket will turn off automatically after four hours.If you use our electric blanket, you can save more than 60% of heating costs per year (depending on the size of the electric blanket). Smooth and skin-friendly: smooth flannel micro plush feels soft and can effectively retain heat.The front of the electric blanket is made of soft flannel and the back is made of fluffy cashmere. Bedding electric blanket provides an extremely soft and skin-friendly experience to protect you from cold weather. Machine washable: The remote control and electric blanket cord can be easily removed from the beautiful blanket, so you can wash our products in a 40° C washing machine. Clean gently, do not bleach, gently stretch the blanket to the appropriate size, and make the blanket smooth after cleaning. Please note that the blanket must be completely dry before use. Safety and environmental protection: the electric blanket has a comprehensive protection system to prevent overheating and short circuit. It will automatically shut off after four hours. Constant temperature protection can ensure a safer user experience. In the cold season, the bedding insulation blanket is the most economical and convenient way to keep the whole body warm and comfortable, which can reduce fatigue and promote blood circulation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71At08qF6JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MEGXIT","source_asin":"B0BPHTW53P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-683388","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPHTW53P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPHTW53P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
