window.products.push({"id":683401,"name":"HIDBEA Activated Bamboo Charcoal Air Purifying Bags (4-Pack) Natural Deodorizer Odor Absorber Eliminator Remover for Home, Pets, Car, Closet, Shoes, 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Pleml3pUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What can these bags do for you?1. Gas purification - These air deodorizing bags are excellent odor absorbers that help remove sweat and body odor and absorb shoes, refrigerators, cars or odors. Filter out airborne dirt.2. Hygroscopicity - There are small leaking houses under the floor or under the wall. These bags can absorb excess water from the air.Why choose our bags?1. Meet different demands – There are 3 different sizes of charcoal air purifying bags for you to choose: 500g (2 packs), 200g (4 packs), 75g (4 packs). You can use them for different places according to your needs.2. Easy to use – Simply set in the sun for 2 hours to fully activate the charcoal. And buckle loop design makes these bamboo charcoal air purifying bags convenient to use and remove, you can hang and place them anywhere you want and remove the bags to clean after long time use.3. Safe and Eco-friendly – Made of 100% activated charcoal and packed with premium gunny-bag, these natural fresh air purifier bags are safe to use and biodegradable, they will not do harm to your family or pollute the environment after you throw them away.4. Reusable, Durable and Cost-effective – For maximizing the efficacy of these air purifying bags, please lay them out under the sun to rejuvenate the bamboo charcoal and make them absorbent again (at least 1 hour per time, recommend time 5 hours) frequently. With proper maintenance, these charcoal bamboo bags can be used for up to 2 years.Where to use them? These charcoal bags are just right for kitchen, bathroom, car, business, pantry, bedroom, garage or anywhere you want to easily remove odors. Some people even put them in their shoes and work boots. It can lengthen the useful life of expensive footwear.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Pleml3pUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HIDBEA","source_asin":"B08FZ2BHWH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-683401","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FZ2BHWH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FZ2BHWH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
