window.products.push({"id":683470,"name":"Olee Sleep Wooden Slat Foundation Bed Frame, No Boxspring Needed. 25mm, Queen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kdDaPvSjL._AC_SL1432_.jpg","description":"Olee Sleep wood slat foundation is the perfect Bed Frame in small spaces. It has 14 inches enough storage space under bed frame. It is able to ship small parcel and is easy to set up. Just unpack, assemble the frame. All standard bed sizes are available, and are strong enough to support heavier your deluxe mattress. This lightweight but durable bed frame is designed to replace both your bed frame and mattress foundation. Superior strength and stability from the solid steel black frame combined with flexibility from the 2-inch wide wooden support slats result in a supportive mattress foundation solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kdDaPvSjL._AC_SL1432_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Olee Sleep","source_asin":"B014K6B2DS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-683470","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B014K6B2DS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B014K6B2DS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
