window.products.push({"id":683745,"name":"ROSOS Accent Cabinet, Accent Cabinet with Doors with Hollow-Out Floral Pattern 2 Shelf, Accent Cabinets for Living Room Stair Corner Entryway Aisle, B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+-su7QlSL._AC_.jpg","description":"Versatile Storage Cabinet: The multipurpose accent cabinet can be placed in the entrance, corridor, living room, bedroom, kitchen, etc. Can be used as a buffet cabinet, pantry cabinet, kitchen storage cabinet, etc. You can also use it as a display cabinet to decorate your home, or use as a functional storage cabinet. Safe & Practical Cabinet: With solid wood frame, the sideboard cabinet is sturdy and durable. The sideboard is equipped with 2 webbing straps, which can install to link the buffet cabinet and the wall, better fix the cabinet and prevent the it from tipping over. Very safe for children, pets and the whole family. Premium Material & Distressed Design: The accent cabinet is constructed with solid wood frame and MDF with fir veneer, makes it stable, durable and attractive. Two metal handle can easily open and close the entryway cabinet. Four solid wood feet are sturdy, durable and heavy duty. Large Capacity: Credenza size: 29.9\" L x 13.8\" W x 32.3\"H. The distressed cabinet is equipped with 2 doors in hollow carved design, not only eye-catching but also can keep the cabinet ventilated. 2 shelf large space can meet different storage demand. The spacious table top can display your plants, photos, and more. Easy to Assemble: The console cabinet is equipped with detailed instructions and clearly indicated accessories, which can be easily assembled. If you have any problems, please feel free to contact us, our professional customer service team is stand by.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+-su7QlSL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ROSOS","source_asin":"B09KY228WW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-683745","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KY228WW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KY228WW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":683746,"name":"Luxury Hand Blown Glass Vase - Decorated with Sandblasted and Painted Red Leaves - in a Golden Gift Box - Clear Square Vase - Red - 9.7 inch (24 cm)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":113.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lCfkkJzkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ANNA'S EXCLUSIVE DECOR NATURE INSPIRED Collection Hand-crafted and decorated finest quality glassware with Swarovski Crystal Elements. About this item This unique centerpiece has been carefully handcrafted and decorated in Poland - famous for its long history of hand-made glass production. The exceptional quality of this product is achieved with time-honoured blown glass techniques that are executed manually by skilled local glassblowers. Combining excellent workmanship with the latest technology, design and decoration techniques allows the creation of elegant centerpieces that are unique in their appeal. Glass products from Poland are famous and generate interest among customers all over the world. Each item is packaged in a protective box - optional Amazon gift wrapping service is available at the checkout. About the process The following three stages of the manufacturing process are executed manually, making each product unique: Stage 1: several minerals including silica sand and soda limestone are carefully measured and melted in a furnace at temperatures reaching 1700°C. Stage 2: a skilled glassblower gathers molten glass at the end of a hollow tube, mouth-blows into the tube while rotating it, using various tools and gravity to create a variety of forms, including vases, bowls, decanters etc. Bubbles of air can sometimes get trapped within the molten glass (and are occasionally visible in finished products) which is an acceptable and authentic part of handmade, mouth-blown glass. After achieving the desired shape, the glassblower cools the molten glass object down. Stage 3: an experienced artisan decorates the glass items using various decorative techniques. Depending on the desired result, the item is sandblasted and/or engraved and painted to create a unique glassware product.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lCfkkJzkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Anna's Exclusive Decor","source_asin":"B07ZRW1G6Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-683746","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZRW1G6Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZRW1G6Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
