window.products.push({"id":683954,"name":"Pourfect 1, 2 and 4 Cup Beaker Set, Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81m-JyTTY4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Introducing the Pourfect line of products- the only complete mix, measure and pour set available in the market today to help perfect standard baking gadgets. Made entirely in the USA, Pourfect Products address common frustrations and mishaps in the kitchen to make food preparation easier, more accurate and tidier for anyone. The Pourfect 1, 2 and 4 cup beaker set in transparent red features a flat edge for a dripless spout, gull wings to eliminate ingredients spilling and a channel that guides wet ingredients toward the spout. It features a comfort grip that fits naturally in hand and bold text for large, easy-to-read English and Metric measurements. The Pourfect beaker set is made with BPA free polycarbonate material so it won't crack, whiten or craze over time. It is completely dishwasher and microwave safe. Made in USA, it has a 1 year warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81m-JyTTY4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"POURfect","source_asin":"B004AE1ZH4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-683954","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004AE1ZH4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004AE1ZH4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":683955,"name":"Ornavo Home Foldable Tufted Velvet Large Storage Ottoman Bench Foot Rest Stool/Seat - 15\" x 30\" x 15\" (Black Velvet)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iCf8yDiCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Ornavo Home storage ottoman will instantly be the star of the living room, family room or den. Crafted with sleek velvet upholstery, while its cushioned top offers extra seating for guests. The contemporary styling of the piece matches numerous decor styles, allowing you to continue using the ottoman when you update your furnishings and your home's decorative accent pieces. From media accessories to books and magazines, this piece stores items so that you can declutter your living area, and enjoy lounging in style. DURABILITY: The luxurious feel of the velvet upholstery is comfortable and inviting, and its durable construction ensures the ottoman's place in your home for a long time. STORAGE SPACE: Store exercise equipment, household accessories or extra linens inside this spacious ottoman, and use the top as a foot rest or extra seating when you're relaxing with friends in the living room. DESIGN: The tufted ottoman is the perfect addition to any room that is in need of an ottoman that can double as a comfortable seat. This ottoman is both soft and stylish, giving you the best of both worlds, allowing you to relax knowing that your guests are comfortable. COMFORTABILITY: Thick cushioning creates a plush place to sit or to rest your feet, while the sturdy base offers added stability. The velvet upholstery lends classic beauty while standing up to regular use in your home. FOLDABLE: It’s lightweight folding design allows you to store this ottoman away when not in use. The comfortable padded lid come off allowing you to fold the ottoman flat and store in any space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iCf8yDiCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ornavo Home","source_asin":"B07QW8ZMN2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-683955","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QW8ZMN2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QW8ZMN2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":683956,"name":"Monarch Specialties I 2-Piece Metal Vanity Set, Black/Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":137.33,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41t8fGNs4YL._AC_.jpg","description":"This classy 2-piece vanity set will be a fabulous addition to your bedroom or dressing area. Create a peaceful space to get ready for your day, or a great place to dress for a fun night out. This-piece features smooth lines, silver metal legs, a vertical swivel mirror, and a center shelf to keep brushes, make-up or other accessories. The rich black finished top and the matching stool, with a comfortably cushioned microfiber, will add sophistication to any room.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41t8fGNs4YL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Monarch Specialties","source_asin":"B07N99TYHQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-683956","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07N99TYHQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07N99TYHQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":683957,"name":"ColorGo Chip Bag Sealer, 2 in 1 Hand Held Mini Portable Heat Sealer for Plastic Bags Food Storage Resealer with Safety Lock [Upgrade Version & Patent ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zguhXd4-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Function Upgraded】: Are you still thinking about how to deal with those leftover snacks? ColorGo upgraded 2 in 1 mini heat sealer help you storage leftover snacks, foods,fruits and so on, to avoid waste and mould growth, keep foods freshness. You can easily sealing bags by rotate the knob indication point to “+” position, and open bags by rotate the knob indication point to “-” point (please slide from left to right). Opening and sealing become one，make your life get more easier. 【Patent Technology-Double Heating Wire】: Our chip bag sealer from monofilament fever upgraded to double heating wire, which adopt double heat sealing construction, and combined with principles of hot melt sealing, easy to seal bags. 0.13 inches sealing caliber which seal more stronger without air leakage. Make sure foods has its original flavor when you eat in next time. 【Triple Security】: This heat sealer for plastic bags use a patented clutch switch, press on and rotate power off, to prevent misoperation. The sealing area adopt a small opening design, the heating wire is hidden inside the opening and uneasy to touch, anti -scald. Safety lock can not be pressed once locked, prevent children from hurting. 【Compact and Portable】: The size of this mini heat sealing machine is 4.33x1.89x2.20 inches, compact and portable. Magnetic strip on back of hand held food sealer allows you stick it to refrigerator and microwave oven, saving space. You also can put it into your backpack for camping, hiking, fishing or vacation，and use it to reseal those leftover snack bags or fruit bags when you left. 【Customer Guarantee】: ColorGo mini portable heat sealer can sealing multiple common packaging bags, such as storage bags,chip bags,coffee bags and so on. It can fully meets your daily use requirements,we are confident you will love it! If our portable food sealer does not reach to your expectations, we will replacement it or full refund you-absolutely risk free, ORDER IT NOW!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zguhXd4-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COLORGO","source_asin":"B07D2DNQFQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-683957","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07D2DNQFQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07D2DNQFQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
