window.products.push({"id":683990,"name":"Iwanda Bathroom Rug Mat Extra Soft Absorbent Premium Bath Rug Non-Slip Comfortable Bath Mat Carpet for Tub, Shower, Bath Room, Machine Washable (Blue,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PQZYmH-TL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Super Soft and Luxurious Bathroom Mat: The luxury bathroom shower rugs set is made of premium thick microfiber fabric materials. This bathroom mat measures about 20\"x32\"(50x80cm) and the thickness is 1 inches(25mm), which is particularly soft and can provide enough support for you. Every time you walk on the shaggy microfiber mat barefoot, the soft pile fabric can soothe your tired feet. Non Slip and Ultra Absorbent Bath Rug: The non slip bath floor mat for bathroom uses non-slip TPR as the bottom material. It can improve friction and safety on various floors including wooden floors and ceramic tiles. No worry about slipping in the bathroom. Water Absorbent Bathroom Floor Mats: Iwanda microfiber plush bath rug has super good water absorption. It can help save your floors from dripping water while you're getting out of the bath, shower or getting ready by the sink; The thickened shower mats for bathroom will quickly absorbs the moisture from wet feet and locks the moisture in the bathmat to keep your feet dry and to protect your feet from the cold floors. Machine Washable Bath Shower Mat: The Solid blue bathroom rugs are easy to clean. You can toss it into the washing machine, wash it in cold water and hang it to dry or air dry. The bath shower mat can be dried quickly and adopts newer advanced fiber locking technology. Our dozens of machine washing tests show that the bath floor carpet can withstand frequent machine washing without deformation, ideal for frequent use and busy households. Multiple Uses Bathroom Rug: Iwanda bathroom mat use the stylish geometric pattern design, which can be perfectly matched with towels and other bathroom decorations or accessories. Perfect for various occasions such as bathroom, toilet, tub, kitchen, bedroom, door entrances, patio entry ways, beauty care business, pet house, and so on. It is also ideal as a gift for your loved ones on Christmas, wedding, Father’s Day or Mother’s Day.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PQZYmH-TL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Iwanda","source_asin":"B091DWPZL9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-683990","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091DWPZL9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091DWPZL9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":683991,"name":"EdgeStar Deluxe Mini Kegerator & Draft Beer Dispenser - Stainless Steel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41NETtkg94L._AC_.jpg","description":"The 5-Liter EdgeStar TBC50S Mini Kegerator is lightweight and easily portable, making it the perfect option for use at home, at barbecues, or in an RV -delivering perfectly poured draft beer every time. This kegerator comes with the Heineken-style tap, for pressurized mini draft kegs. And with as little as 3 parts it's a snap to assemble and begin enjoying. The unit uses thermoelectric technology for ultra-quiet, energy efficient operation. Free of ozone-depleting CFCs and HCFCs, the thermoelectric cooling system is also ecologically friendly. This beer dispenser holds any standard size (5 liter) mini beer keg. Its' compact size and both AC and DC power adapters standard the EdgeStar 5L Mini Kegerator can go from being on the counter of a home bar to the countertop of an RV. With a steel brushed drip tray and sleek design The EdgeStar 5L mini kegerator is perfect for any beer connoisseur.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41NETtkg94L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EdgeStar","source_asin":"B000Z7HMPO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-683991","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000Z7HMPO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000Z7HMPO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
